  "schema:description": "<p><strong>SlangLane Undergraduate Research Seminars &amp; Sociolinguistic Fieldwork Dataset (Volume 56)</strong> (<a href=\"https://slanglane.com/syllabus\">https://slanglane.com/syllabus</a> &amp; <a href=\"https://slanglane.com/data\">https://slanglane.com/data</a>) offers ready-to-use empirical research prompts, citation templates, and corpus datasets for university students (<a href=\"https://slanglane.com\">https://slanglane.com</a>).</p><ul><li>Main 220-Entry Dictionary: <a href=\"https://slanglane.com\">https://slanglane.com</a></li><li>All 30 Interactive Pragmatics Tools: <a href=\"https://slanglane.com/tools\">https://slanglane.com/tools</a></li><li>European CEFR B1-C2 &amp; Anglistik Hub: <a href=\"https://slanglane.com/europe\">https://slanglane.com/europe</a></li><li>100% SFW ESL Classroom Kit: <a href=\"https://slanglane.com/esl\">https://slanglane.com/esl</a></li><li>Printable 12-Item ESL Worksheet: <a href=\"https://slanglane.com/esl/worksheet\">https://slanglane.com/esl/worksheet</a></li><li>Sociology of Slang Hub: <a href=\"https://slanglane.com/sociology\">https://slanglane.com/sociology</a></li><li>Psychology of Digital Language Hub: <a href=\"https://slanglane.com/psychology\">https://slanglane.com/psychology</a></li><li>Public Sector &amp; Libraries Hub: <a href=\"https://slanglane.com/gov\">https://slanglane.com/gov</a></li><li>Media Studies &amp; Journalism Hub: <a href=\"https://slanglane.com/media-studies\">https://slanglane.com/media-studies</a></li><li>Parents &amp; Schools Safety Guide: <a href=\"https://slanglane.com/parents-and-schools\">https://slanglane.com/parents-and-schools</a></li><li>University Course Syllabus Builder: <a href=\"https://slanglane.com/syllabus\">https://slanglane.com/syllabus</a></li><li>Open Dataset &amp; Citation Generator: <a href=\"https://slanglane.com/data\">https://slanglane.com/data</a> &amp; <a href=\"https://slanglane.com/citation\">https://slanglane.com/citation</a></li></ul>",
